Subject: Fold the light call into the classifier

What this does
  Fold the light call into the classifier.

Why we need it
  The out-of-line light handler re-decoded operand `c` and reloaded `FR(c)` and the function bytecode.

What it adds
  Which owns the `musttail` record fallback.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
